 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508101,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Later in her trip, Mabel decides to drive to the capital of Canada, Ottawa. As she left Montreal, she saw a road sign that read that Ottawa is 203 kilometers away. About how many miles is that? Round your answer to the nearest tenth.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>0.62 miles is approximately 1 kilometer.</p>\n<p>Montreal is 203 kilometers away.</p>\n<p>Let <i>x</i> = the distance to Montreal in miles.</p>\n<p>It helps many students to create a table to help set up their ratios.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Conversion</td>\n<td>What I have or want</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kilometers</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>203</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>miles</td>\n<td>0.62</td>\n<td><i>x</i></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Set up your proportion.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{{0.62}} = \\frac{{203}}{x}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = \\left( {0.62} \\right)\\left( {203} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>Cross multiply.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x \\approx 125.9{\\rm{ miles}}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The distance to Montreal is approximately 125.9 miles.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "125.9 miles"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
